# An action whose argument faults halts the tier. `emit_bad` writes
# `zeta: i.txt + i.txt` in the crafted artefact (47_emit_softfail.ds): `+` on
# two Strings, an EngineError on a clean node. Every verb checks its arguments
# before acting ([LERR.1]), so no `emit` reaches working memory, and the fault
# reaches the halt latch ([NCBK.2.9]). The firing bracket opens and closes
# around no verb.
assert In id=1 txt=ab
pump
